Faddeeva package (src/faddeeva.nabi)
  w(z) and the functions built on it follow S. G. Johnson's Faddeeva
  package (http://ab-initio.mit.edu/Faddeeva): its region split, its
  bottom-up continued fraction and its form of the Algorithm 916 sums
  with a precomputed e^(-a^2 n^2) table. That package is itself an
  independent reimplementation of Zaghloul and Ali's Algorithm 916 (ACM
  TOMS 38(2), 2011) from the paper, not from ACM's code. No code of ACM's
  Algorithm 916 is in special.

