Cephes Math Library (src/elliptic/jacobi.nabi)
  The descending Landen transformation of `ellipj`, including its
  small-m series, follows Cephes' ellpj. The integer-order Bessel
  functions (src/bessel/integer.nabi) take Cephes' layout of ranges and
  forms only; their coefficients are fitted anew.

